  "question": {
    "text": "The internal resistance of the cell shown in the figure is negligible. On closing the key <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>, the ammeter reading changes from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, then what is the value of resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;(in ohm)?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0110_6e0864abb33a.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 154px; width: 200px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "When <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math> was open<br /><br />Reading of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>0.25</mn></math>,<br /><br />When <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math> was closed<br /><br />Reading of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>0.5</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>"
